OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786817921
OL,3,CMarine heatwave devastates seagrass
OL,4,Cconservation project on Welsh coast
OL,6,FScientists trying to restore Britain's
OL,7,Fdisappearing seagrass meadows say
OL,8,Frising sea temperatures could make the
OL,9,Ftask increasingly difficult, after a
OL,10,Fmarine heatwave devastated a planting
OL,11,Fsite in north Wales.
OL,13,FSeagrass meadows play an important
OL,14,Frole in tackling both climate change
OL,15,Fand biodiversity loss, but the UK has
OL,16,Flost around 90% of its seagrass
OL,17,Fmeadows over the last century.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
