PN,31202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786817921
OL,3,CMarine heatwave devastates seagrass
OL,4,Cconservation project on Welsh coast
OL,6,FSeagrass can capture carbon up to 35
OL,7,Ftimes faster than tropical
OL,8,Frainforests, while its meadows provide
OL,9,Fhabitats for marine life and can help
OL,10,Fprotect coastlines from erosion.
OL,12,FOn the Llyn Peninsula, scientists from
OL,13,FSwansea University and Project
OL,14,FSeagrass are working with local
OL,15,Fcommunities to try to bring some of
OL,16,Fthose lost meadows back.
OL,18,FThe work forms part of Seagrass Ocean
OL,19,FRescue North Wales, supported by WWF-
OL,20,FUK with funding from the National
OL,21,FLottery Heritage Fund.
OL,26,@tD@Js|
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786817921
OL,3,CMarine heatwave devastates seagrass
OL,4,Cconservation project on Welsh coast
OL,6,FAt Porthdinllaen, volunteers snorkel
OL,7,Fthrough an established seagrass meadow
OL,8,Fcollecting seeds, which are later
OL,9,Fplanted at carefully selected
OL,10,Frestoration sites.
OL,12,FLaura Hughes, Marine Project Officer
OL,13,Fat Pen Llyn a'r Sarnau Special Area of
OL,14,FConservation, said involving local
OL,15,Fpeople had become an important part of
OL,16,Fthe work.
OL,26,@uD@Js|
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786817921
OL,3,CMarine heatwave devastates seagrass
OL,4,Cconservation project on Welsh coast
OL,6,F"We've been able to bring people out
OL,7,Fand get them hands-on with active
OL,8,Fconservation. So the seed picking, and
OL,9,Fthen the seeds that we pick here in
OL,10,Fthe summer, we then go out to plant
OL,11,Fthem in different locations. The
OL,12,Fvolunteers and communities can be a
OL,13,Fpart of that as well."
OL,15,FBut one attempt to establish a new
OL,16,Fmeadow nearby ended in disaster.
OL,18,FMore than 500,000 seeds collected at
OL,19,FPorthdinllaen were planted by hand at
OL,20,FTraeth Crugan, in Bae Tremadog.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
