PN,31205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786817921
OL,3,CMarine heatwave devastates seagrass
OL,4,Cconservation project on Welsh coast
OL,6,FDr Richard Unsworth, Associate
OL,7,FProfessor at Swansea University and
OL,8,FLead Scientist at Project Seagrass,
OL,9,Fsaid there had initially been every
OL,10,Freason to believe the project would
OL,11,Fsucceed.
OL,13,F"Over 500,000 seeds were planted into
OL,14,Fthis bay. The seeds were really
OL,15,Fhealthy. Everything was going in a
OL,16,Freally positive direction."
OL,18,FBut when scientists returned to
OL,19,Fmonitor the site, almost everything
OL,20,Fhad disappeared.
OL,26,@uD@AOUxD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
