PN,31206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786817921
OL,3,CMarine heatwave devastates seagrass
OL,4,Cconservation project on Welsh coast
OL,6,FDr Oliver Thomas, Senior Scientist at
OL,7,FProject Seagrass, said: "We came down
OL,8,Fto the beach and sort of planned this
OL,9,Fbig monitoring program, and then we
OL,10,Ffound nothing, nothing at all.
OL,12,F"I think, we found a single shoot,
OL,13,Fsort of just towards that buoy, and
OL,14,Fthat was it. It was just bare sand."
OL,16,F"It was devastating," says Dr Unsworth.
OL,18,FIt took several months of
OL,19,Finvestigation to establish what had
OL,20,Fhappened.
OL,26,@oD@YOUtD@AOUvD@dO]xD@AOUxD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786817921
OL,3,CMarine heatwave devastates seagrass
OL,4,Cconservation project on Welsh coast
OL,6,FResearchers eventually identified a
OL,7,Frapid marine heatwave, during which
OL,8,Ftemperatures rose by around 3.5C in
OL,9,Fless than a week.
OL,11,FDr Thomas said: "It was an increase of
OL,12,F3.5 degrees over five or six days
OL,13,Fwhich, in marine terms, is
OL,14,Funprecedented. And when you've got a
OL,15,Ftiny little seagrass shoot, it can
OL,16,Fprove quite deleterious."
OL,18,FScientists are concerned increasingly
OL,19,Fintense marine heatwaves could pose a
OL,20,Fgrowing challenge to restoration
OL,21,Fprojects around Britain.
OL,26,@sD@QOUxD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786817921
OL,3,CMarine heatwave devastates seagrass
OL,4,Cconservation project on Welsh coast
OL,6,FBut the failed planting has also
OL,7,Fchanged how the team works. Lessons
OL,8,Ffrom Traeth Crugan have helped
OL,9,Fscientists identify another site near
OL,10,FHolyhead which is considered more
OL,11,Fresilient to extreme temperatures.
OL,13,FAnd back at Porthdinllaen, another
OL,14,Fgroup of volunteers is gathering the
OL,15,Fseeds that could eventually help
OL,16,Fcreate the next meadow.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
